# Monorepo DTS-E-Commerce

Repo: `git@github.com:osedhelu/DTS-E-Commerce.git`

## Estructura

- `backend/` — Django API (uv, no pip)
- `web-admin/` — Next.js + Tailwind (merchant/admin)
- `flutter-customer/` — App cliente
- `flutter-driver/` — App conductor
- Raíz: `Makefile`, `docker-compose.yml`, `scripts/`

## Comandos raíz

```bash
make setup            # Docker + deps
make backend-test     # pytest
make web-admin-dev    # Next.js :3000
make flutter-test     # flutter test x2
```

## Docker obligatorio para dev backend

PostGIS + Redis: `make docker-up`

